  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1032830,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 19 Music for Commodore 64: A Symphony of Innovation\n\nStep back in time to 1985 and experience *19 Music*, a groundbreaking music creation game for the Commodore 64. Forget complex programming – this title offers an unprecedentedly accessible way to compose and perform your own music directly on your home computer. \n\nUtilizing a user-friendly graphical interface, *19 Music* allows players to intuitively drag and drop musical notes, sharps, and other musical symbols onto a virtual staff.  Compose melodies, harmonies, and entire musical pieces with ease, then instantly hear your creations come to life through the Commodore 64’s distinctive sound chip. \n\nThe game’s robust features include cut, copy, and paste functionality for seamless editing, enabling you to refine your compositions with precision.  Share your musical talents by printing your scores, or simply enjoy the satisfaction of crafting your own unique soundtracks. *19 Music* isn't just a game; it's a gateway to musical creativity for everyone, regardless of experience. Rediscover the joy of music creation in a retro style!"
    },
